  "text": "Optional profile law is selected by actual adopted scope, not language, pure/local status or available documents. DESIGN_MODULE governs module realization; adopted ODD additionally owns graph-native operative carriers and traversal authority; a realized UX surface additionally needs its applicable UX law, default-trigger/exemption determination and actual product carrier. ODD, TRAVERSAL_OCCURRENCE and WORLD_MODEL are distinct optional profiles: ODD does not imply the latter two, and world-model/metaphysical framing is not a prerequisite to engineering Ontology. If task-specific adopted law outside this exact method-constraint closure materially decides the task, acquire it through the named Product authority packet before that action; this index does not claim to replace it.",
